{"seq":2,"slug":"test-design-techniques","title":"测试用例设计技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-testing-qa/foundations/test-design-techniques","wordCount":1666,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"测试用例设计技术\">测试用例设计技术</h1><p>假设要测试一个输入「年龄」的表单字段，规则是 18 到 65 岁可注册。你会输入哪些值？随手敲个 25、再敲个 100 看看报错——这是大多数人的直觉做法，但它既漏掉了真正危险的边界，又在安全区内做了无意义的重复。<a href=\"testing-principles\">测试原则与测试金字塔</a> 已经论证穷举不可行，那么剩下的问题就变成：如何从无穷的输入空间里，系统化地挑出一组「以少胜多」的代表性用例。这正是测试用例设计技术要解决的事——把挑选输入从经验主义变成有理论支撑的工程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>所有黑盒设计技术的共同思想，是把庞大的输入空间<strong>划分成若干区域</strong>，再论证「同一区域内的值在程序眼里行为一致」，于是每个区域只需抽样一两个代表即可。不同技术的区别，在于如何划分区域、以及在哪些位置加密抽样。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[无穷输入空间] --&gt; B[等价类划分&lt;br/&gt;切成行为一致的区块]&#10;    B --&gt; C[边界值分析&lt;br/&gt;在区块边缘加密取样]&#10;    A --&gt; D[判定表&lt;br/&gt;枚举条件组合]&#10;    A --&gt; E[成对组合&lt;br/&gt;压缩多参数爆炸]&#10;    A --&gt; F[状态转换&lt;br/&gt;覆盖状态与迁移]&#10;    C --&gt; G[一组精简且高覆盖的用例]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G\">graph TD\n    A[无穷输入空间] --&gt; B[等价类划分&lt;br/&gt;切成行为一致的区块]\n    B --&gt; C[边界值分析&lt;br/&gt;在区块边缘加密取样]\n    A --&gt; D[判定表&lt;br/&gt;枚举条件组合]\n    A --&gt; E[成对组合&lt;br/&gt;压缩多参数爆炸]\n    A --&gt; F[状态转换&lt;br/&gt;覆盖状态与迁移]\n    C --&gt; G[一组精简且高覆盖的用例]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>划分依据</th>\n<th>主要捕获的缺陷类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等价类划分</td>\n<td>单字段取值范围</td>\n<td>行为等价的输入区间</td>\n<td>范围处理错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边界值分析</td>\n<td>有序的数值/长度边界</td>\n<td>区间的临界点</td>\n<td>差一错误（off-by-one）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>判定表</td>\n<td>多条件组合的业务规则</td>\n<td>条件真值组合</td>\n<td>遗漏的规则分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成对组合</td>\n<td>多个独立参数</td>\n<td>参数对的组合覆盖</td>\n<td>参数交互缺陷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态转换</td>\n<td>有内部状态的系统</td>\n<td>状态与触发事件</td>\n<td>非法迁移、状态泄漏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"等价类划分与边界值分析\">等价类划分与边界值分析</h2><p>回到年龄例子。等价类划分（Equivalence Partitioning）把输入分成行为一致的类：<strong>有效类</strong>是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>18</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>65</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[18, 65]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，<strong>无效类</strong>包括「小于 18」和「大于 65」，以及非数字、负数、空值等异常类。理论依据是：如果程序对 30 和 40 的处理逻辑相同，那么测了 30 就没必要再测 40——它们落在同一等价类里，提供的信息冗余。于是每个等价类抽一个代表即可，瞬间把无穷用例压成有限的几个。</p>\n<p>但等价类划分有个盲区：bug 最爱藏在边界上。把范围写成 <code>age &gt; 18</code> 还是 <code>age &gt;= 18</code>，决定了 18 岁能否注册，这类<strong>差一错误</strong>恰好发生在等价类的交界处。边界值分析（Boundary Value Analysis）专门在边界两侧加密取样。对区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>18</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>65</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[18, 65]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，应测试的关键点是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>17</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>18</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>19</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>64</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>65</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>66</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{17, 18, 19, 64, 65, 66\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">17</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">19</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">66</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>——即每个边界的「上、值、下」三点。形式化地，对边界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，取样集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{b-1, b, b+1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>。经验表明，边界值分析与等价类划分组合使用，能以极小的用例量捕获绝大多数范围类缺陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判定表-驯服条件组合\">判定表：驯服条件组合</h2><p>当输出由多个条件共同决定时，单靠等价类就不够了。设想一个保险定价规则：是否吸烟、是否有既往病史、年龄是否超过 50，三个布尔条件组合出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^3 = 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 种情况，每种对应不同保费。判定表（Decision Table）把这种组合显式地列成一张表，每一列是一种条件组合及其期望动作，强迫你面对每一个分支——遗漏的规则会在表里显形为「空着的列」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件\\规则</th>\n<th>R1</th>\n<th>R2</th>\n<th>R3</th>\n<th>R4</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>吸烟</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>既往病史</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动作</td>\n<td>拒保</td>\n<td>加费 50%</td>\n<td>加费 30%</td>\n<td>标准费率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判定表的价值不只在测试阶段——它本身就是一份无歧义的规格。当条件数增长时，可以用「不可能组合」和「等价合并」来压缩列数，避免表格指数膨胀。这种「先把规则枚举清楚再测」的纪律，也正是 <a href=\"../practice-process/tdd-bdd\">TDD 与 BDD</a> 中 BDD 场景表（Scenario Outline）的思想源头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成对组合-对抗组合爆炸\">成对组合：对抗组合爆炸</h2><p>判定表面对三五个条件还能手画，但当参数变多时会彻底失控。一个安装向导有 4 个下拉框，每个 3 个选项，全组合是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>81</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3^4 = 81</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">81</span></span></span></span></span> 种；若是 10 个参数各 5 个值，全组合达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>977</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5^{10} \\approx 977</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">977</span></span></span></span></span> 万种，无法穷举。成对组合（Pairwise / All-Pairs Testing）背后是一个经验观察：<strong>大多数缺陷由单个参数或两个参数的交互触发，三个以上参数同时作怪的缺陷极为罕见</strong>。因此只需保证「任意两个参数的每一种取值组合都至少出现一次」，而不必覆盖全部高阶组合。</p>\n<p>用正交数组或贪心算法（如工具 PICT、AllPairs）可以把前述 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>81</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3^4=81</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">81</span></span></span></span></span> 种压缩到 9 个用例左右，却仍覆盖所有参数对。数学上，对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个参数、每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 个取值，成对覆盖所需用例数下界约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，远小于全组合的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这种「用平方级换指数级」的取舍，是大规模配置测试的标准武器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基于状态的设计\">基于状态的设计</h2><p>前面几种技术都假设「输入决定输出」，但有状态的系统不满足这个假设——同样点击「提交」，在「草稿」状态和「已发布」状态下结果完全不同。状态转换测试（State Transition Testing）用状态机建模系统：节点是状态，边是「事件 / 动作」。测试目标从「覆盖输入」变成「覆盖状态与迁移」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[草稿] --&gt;|提交| B[审核中]&#10;    B --&gt;|通过| C[已发布]&#10;    B --&gt;|驳回| A&#10;    C --&gt;|下架| D[已归档]&#10;    A --&gt;|删除| D\">flowchart TD\n    A[草稿] --&gt;|提交| B[审核中]\n    B --&gt;|通过| C[已发布]\n    B --&gt;|驳回| A\n    C --&gt;|下架| D[已归档]\n    A --&gt;|删除| D</pre><p>至少要做到<strong>所有合法迁移都被覆盖</strong>（边覆盖），更严格的还要测试<strong>非法迁移</strong>——比如对「已归档」的内容再次点「提交」，系统应当拒绝而非崩溃。状态机模型还能自然衍生出长路径用例（连续多次迁移），暴露状态泄漏类缺陷。这类有状态系统的端到端验证，会在 <a href=\"../test-levels/e2e-testing\">端到端与系统测试</a> 中再次出现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>一切黑盒设计技术的核心都是「划分输入空间 + 在关键处加密取样」，把穷举换成代表性抽样。</li>\n<li>等价类划分挑代表、边界值分析守边界（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{b-1, b, b+1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>），两者组合捕获大多数范围类缺陷。</li>\n<li>判定表枚举多条件组合、让遗漏的规则显形，同时是一份可执行的规格。</li>\n<li>成对组合用「任意两参数组合至少出现一次」对抗组合爆炸，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>状态转换测试面向有状态系统，覆盖合法迁移并主动验证非法迁移。</li>\n<li>这些方法决定「测什么输入」，与 <a href=\"coverage-metrics\">覆盖率与有效性</a> 关注的「测得够不够」互为表里。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"测试用例设计技术","id":"测试用例设计技术"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"等价类划分与边界值分析","id":"等价类划分与边界值分析"},{"level":2,"text":"判定表：驯服条件组合","id":"判定表-驯服条件组合"},{"level":2,"text":"成对组合：对抗组合爆炸","id":"成对组合-对抗组合爆炸"},{"level":2,"text":"基于状态的设计","id":"基于状态的设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"测试原则与测试金字塔","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-testing-qa/foundations/testing-principles"},"next":{"title":"覆盖率与有效性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/software-testing-qa/foundations/coverage-metrics"}}